 "remarks": "**Highest & best offers due on Wednesday 10/7 at noon** Welcome to Ridgeway House at 50 Reynolds Avenue, a lovingly cared for home in a fantastic downtown Stamford location, cherished by the same family for nearly 60 years. Behind its classic raised ranch profile is a home that feels honest, comfortable, and full of possibility. The upper level offers two bedrooms, a full bath and inviting living spaces with hardwood floors and designed for everyday life. Downstairs, the home reveals another dimension: a spacious family room anchored by a wood burning stove, an additional bedroom and a second full bath. It's a wonderfully flexible arrangement for overnight guests, extended family, a home office or multigenerational living. What makes this home special is the feeling of a house that has been genuinely loved. Nearly six decades of holidays, milestones and everyday moments have unfolded here. Just minutes from downtown Stamford, Metro North station and the Greenwich town line in the Ridgeway neighborhood, this house has everything you can ever want in a home. New roof in 2023 and central A/C in 2020. A truly remarkable find!",
